[ext_resource type="Script" uid="uid://b8unc74nyhjr0" path="res://engine/character/gear_action/action.gd" id="1_action"]
[ext_resource type="Script" uid="uid://ckrv6mvs5q65e" path="res://engine/character/gear/kit.gd" id="2_kit"]
[ext_resource type="Resource" path="res://unpacked/Reag-TheSixthVoice/res/content/gear/horus/systems/ms_twilight_swarm/action_damnation_of_the_host.tres" id="3_damnation"]

; TWILIGHT SWARM, the Sluagh's rank-II Unique shield system (SP3 Task 3). Task 4 appends the Crown
; beside Damnation, in the CARD'S ORDER (specs/sixth-voice/08-sluagh.md:80-85) - which is the order
; the gear bar draws, so it is player-visible. ms_o_trickery.tres is the mod's own two-actions-on-one-
; system precedent, and vanilla's ms_aggressive_system_sync is the original: both actions are plain
; entries in `actions`, no variant group and no sub-menu, each taking its localisation rows from its
; own file stem under the Kit's id.
;
; THE CARD'S FOUR TAGS ARE THREE FIELDS AND ONE NOTHING.
;   UNIQUE | SHIELD = 1 | 16 = 17 (Kit.SYSTEM_TAGS, kit.gd:30).
;   LIMITED 3       = charges_max = 3.
;   OVERSHIELD      = NOTHING. There is no such flag in the engine - it is an LCP-side descriptor,
;                     and it is the SYSTEM'S EFFECT that makes the card true, not a tag.
; Vanilla's own content/gear/ipsn/systems/ms_aceso_stabilizer/ms_aceso_stabilizer.tres carries the
; identical four card tags and ships exactly `system_tags = 17` and `charges_max = 3` and nothing
; else. This is a copy of that decision, not a new one. test_the_profile_matches_the_card asserts
; is_ai() and is_nhp() FALSE as well as the two true bits, because a wrong literal (9, 21, 25) would
; satisfy a has-check on either bit that matters.
;
; No icon_override - SP5 owes this Kit its glyph, shared with action_damnation_of_the_host as one
; family (design section 5); the Crown gets a family of its own. The ICON_TARGETS row is what keeps
; that debt visible as a deliberate red until then.
[resource]
script = ExtResource("2_kit")
actions = Array[ExtResource("1_action")]([ExtResource("3_damnation")])
sp_cost = 2
system_tags = 17
charges_max = 3
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://ckrv6mvs5q65e"
